      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1750540858192,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n1. Run a workflow when triggered by an external event\n2. Workflow can have 1 or more tasks, tasks can have dependencies between each\n    other\n3. Multitenant system\n---\nNon Functional Requirements",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n1. Run a workflow when triggered by an external event\n2. Workflow can have 1 or more tasks, tasks can have dependencies between each\n    other\n3. Multitenant system\n---\nNon Functional Requirements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-NWR19UhpEO3uWJ-iJkhb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1199.34619140625,
      "y": -256.47265625,
      "width": 623.6595458984375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1282820666,
      "version": 371,
      "versionNonce": 1168963430,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1750542639977,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. CA -> Available\n2. Task should be executed at least once\n3.  Scalable - should be able to handle > 10^4 workflows/second",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. CA -> Available\n2. Task should be executed at least once\n3.  Scalable - should be able to handle > 10^4 workflows/second",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
