      "text": "Worker API\n\ngetNextTasks(count): []TaskRun\nack(task_id): error -> OCC so that only one worker is able to execute it\nping(): error -> worker keep alive\nupdateTaskStatus(task_id, status): error\nwatch(task_id): error -> task keep alive",
